# Scratch capture of a `bun run test` run, redirected to the repo root rather
# than the scratchpad. 197 KB of console output with no reader — the suite
# regenerates it on demand, and a stale copy of a passing run is exactly the
# kind of artifact that gets mistaken for evidence later.
/test_output.txt

# One-off capture output from the build_scripts/audit/ crawlers and a Figma
# token export — ~7,000 lines of machine-written fixtures that nothing in the
# build, the tests or the app reads. `data/page_inventory.*` is already ignored
# above for the same reason; these were simply missed, which is not a harmless
# omission: commit 594cec9 untracked exactly these seven files after a
# `git add -A` swept them in, and with no ignore rule a later `git add -A` put
# every one of them straight back. An ignore entry is what makes that
# correction hold rather than needing to be made again.
/data/audit_fixtures/
/data/figma-tokens.json
/data/figma-components-kit.svg
/data/figma-swatches.svg
